# {{PLUGIN_NAME}} — oh-my-pi (omp) notes

oh-my-pi (omp) is a fork of pi. This plugin is installed via:

```sh
omp plugin install git:github.com/<owner>/{{PLUGIN_NAME}}
```

- The `package.json` carries both `pi` and `omp` fields (`pkg.omp` preferred,
  `pkg.pi` fallback — see plugin-factory references/plugins/oh-my-pi.md).
- The bootstrap extension (`.pi/extensions/{{PLUGIN_PREFIX}}-bootstrap.ts`)
  follows the pi extension API, which omp keeps compatible.
- Reload plugins with `/reload-plugins`.
